# The Ooze's ability twice on the same creature card (the ruling): the second to resolve finds its target gone from the
# graveyard (CR 608.2b, 400.7) and does nothing, so there is only one counter (3/3) and one life (21). A card on the
# battlefield (Bot2's Mox Jet) is not a legal target (`!`): the target must be a card in a graveyard.

